The packed-B descriptors as lowered (native:unroll2:1, <job-tmp>/native_unroll2_csb1.prj/
input_with_addresses.mlir), sizes and strides in bytes:
  memtile B -> core  aie.dma_bd(%B_L3L2_0_cons_buff_0 : memref<4096xi8> offset = 0 len = 4096
                     sizes = [8, 8, 16, 4] strides = [512, 4, 32, 1])
  memtile A -> core  aie.dma_bd(%A_L3L2_0_cons_buff_0 : memref<8192xi8> offset = 0 len = 8192
                     sizes = [16, 8, 4, 16] strides = [512, 16, 128, 1])
  core B buffer      aie.dma_bd(%B_L2L1_0_0_cons_buff_0 : memref<128x32xi8> offset = 0 len = 4096)
B's transform is [(k/s, s*n/2), (n/t, t/2), (s, n/2), (t/2, 1)] = 16 x 8 int4 blocks as 16 rows of
4 bytes: an innermost dimension of one 32-bit word, where the int8 design's is two.

